SUMMARY:Music of the 50's to 70's 
DESCRIPTION:Hendo Fun Friends\nCome sing along with music from the 50's-70
 's.\n\nWe're looking forward to being back at this beautiful new venue!\n\
 nThey have beer\, wine\, cider and soft drinks. There's no food truck on s
 ite so feel free to bring snacks. They do offer a charcuterie board.\n\nCo
 me help us support this new local business.\n\nPlease be sure to purchase 
 something.
